OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain to
OL,6,Fstart the evening will clear towards
OL,7,Fmidnight, to leave largely dry
OL,8,Fconditions with clear spells. Becoming
OL,9,Fchilly with a frost developing in
OL,10,Fprone rural spots. Winds easing
OL,11,Fthrough the night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FA chilly start, but
OL,14,Fgenerally a bright day with sunny
OL,15,Fspells and a few isolated showers,
OL,16,Fmainly in the west. Winds mostly light
OL,17,Fthroughout. Rain arriving overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
